            "review_text": "Maria\nDallas, Texas5 contributions\n0\nStar employee at Danang Airport\nOct 2024 • Couples\nI had a fantastic experience at the Burger King in Da Nang Airport, all thanks to an incredible employee. He was friendly, attentive, and went above and beyond to make sure everything was perfect, handling my requests quickly and with a smile. His hard work and genuine care made my visit so much better—such a rare find in an airport! Huge thanks for the amazing service!\nWritten November 28, 2024",
