            "review_text": "Leo0007\nBangkok, Thailand1025 contributions\n0\nThe in Da Nang\nOct 2024 • Friends\nI arrived when the airport had just opened, when I entered the restricted area, I immediately stopped by the BURGER KING restaurant, the staff here were very friendly, welcomed me warmly and advised me on dishes that suited my taste, especially the price, the newly released dishes were DELICIOUS and HOT, eye-catching decoration. Especially all items such as paper straws, lids and paper cups, ALL are friendly and reusable to protect the environment. I was warmly welcomed by Manager Thang from the moment I stepped into the store until I left. A GREAT EXPERIENCE IN VIETNAM\nWritten October 29, 2024",
