            "review_text": "Samuel R\n23 contributions\n1\nDa Nang Burger King: You Rule!\nNov 2023 • Couples\nWith nearly three weeks of eating nothing but authentic, delicious Vietnamese, Cambodian, and Thai food, it might seem surprising that we also enjoyed one indulgence: a Burger King meal at Da Nang airport. It really did hit the spot, though. I mean, flame broiled burgers (allegedly with Korean seasoning that tasted suspiciously like every American Burger King burger), crispy fries, and sugary drinks, we \"had it our way.\" The staff were also way nicer than we're used to for a Burger King.\nWritten January 2, 2024",
