            "review_text": "LaurentCL2\nAlassio, Italy2224 contributions\n2\nThe most expensive Burger King in the world!!!\nMar 2020\nWhen you think that a cheeseburger anywhere in Vietnam cost 50.000 ₫, which is 2 euros, this ripoff Burger King at Da Nang Airport charges you $4 for one cheeseburger and $17-18 for a meal!!! Unheard of!!!\n\nThe cheese in the cheeseburger was half way out of the burger and there was no cheese in the fish burger and almost no sauce. The fish was deep fried and completely greasy. Disgusting!!!!\nThey had only me and another customer. It is so difficult to center a slice of cheese in a burger or is it rocket science?\n\nOn top of that, they have lots of staff but they all stay behind the counter instead of cleaning tables. There were 8 dirty tables around me.\n\nShame on them!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2020",
